In Meat products pollution with aluminium may be due to the
use of aluminium utensils, acidic solutions for the preparation
of chilly chicken, Tandoori chicken like products, butter, oil
and spices, as well as the packaging materials like aluminium
foil. Aluminum is also used to make beverage cans, pots and
pans, airplanes, siding and roofing, and foil. Powdered
aluminum metal is often used in explosives and fireworks.
Aluminum compounds are used in many diverse and
important industrial applications such as alums (aluminum
sulfate) in water-treatment and alumina in abrasives and
furnace linings. Aluminum is found in consumer products
