Content of major and trace elements in raw ewes’ milk
used for production of traditional white brined cheese
V. LEVKOV1*, T. STAFILOV2, N. PACINOVSKI1, K. BAČEVA3, N. MATEVA1, N. GJORGOVSKA1,
