J. Chem. Soc. Nigeria, Vol. 46, No.2, pp 0283 – 0288 [2021]
Studies on some heavy metal contents of ximenia americana and sclerocarya birrea wild fruit from
North-Eastern Nigeria.
G.A Maspalma 1*, U.A Maryam1, M.B. Hamid2, K.S Hamman3 and S.P Artimas1.
Chemistry Unit, Department of Science Laboratory Technology, Adamawa State Polytechnic Yola,
Adamawa State, Nigeria.
2
Biochemistry Unit, Department of Science Laboratory Technology, Adamawa State Polytechnic Yola,
Adamawa State, Nigeria.
3
